Houthis launch more attacks at Yemen’s Mocha  






                  Yemen’s government-aligned military indicated that Houthi forces launched ballistic missiles at the Red Sea port city of Mocha.&nbsp; 

 The attack is one of several launched by the Houthis in recent days, amid renewed hostilities between them and the government's troops.

